OldaleTown_Text_H0::
    .string "Everyone crossing south HOENN\n"
    .string "stops in OLDALE.\p"
    .string "Nobody stays. We don't mind.\n"
    .string "We like hearing where they're off\l"
    .string "to next.$"

OldaleTown_Text_H1::
    .string "Hello! I work at the POKéMON MART\n"
    .string "just over there.\p"
    .string "We're handing out samples today.\n"
    .string "Here, one for the road!$"

OldaleTown_Text_H2::
    .string "Shh! I'm sketching footprints.\p"
    .string "Small, webbed, heading west toward\n"
    .string "the sea. A water POKéMON, a long\l"
    .string "way from any swamp.\p"
    .string "Where did it come from? Where is\n"
    .string "it going? Don't step on them!$"

OldaleTown_Text_H3::
    .string "OLDALE TOWN\n"
    .string "“Where the roads stop to rest.”$"

OldaleTown_Text_ClerkAfterGift::
    .string "That's a HYPER POTION. We don't\n"
    .string "even stock those.\p"
    .string "The supplier sent one by mistake.\n"
    .string "Better you than the shelf!$"

OldaleTown_Text_ClerkLater::
    .string "Our MART's small, but it never\n"
    .string "closes. Drop in any time!$"

OldaleTown_Text_ClerkBagFull::
    .string "Oh, your BAG's full! I'll keep it\n"
    .string "behind the counter for you.$"
